  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "初级行政助理  (Junior Administrative Assistant)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Walking past cheap-housing flyers outside campus, Bu Xiaogu makes a bold choice: instead of leaving television, she interviews back at Xingtian for an entry-level administrative job. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "毕业以后咱们也得在城里扎个根。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看这张传单，写着最低价租房，还介绍工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你想好接下来找什么工作了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想回星天应聘初级行政助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你确认真的可以入职吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请问这个职位是属于哪个部门？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听说星天重业务轻行政，没有专门的行政部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司只有两个行政助理，负责全公司的杂务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "做全公司的杂务，你不觉得委屈吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对我来说，足够了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "毕业以后咱们也得在城里扎个根。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After graduation we need to put down roots in the city too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看这张传单，写着最低价租房，还介绍工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at this flyer offering the lowest-priced rentals and job referrals.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你想好接下来找什么工作了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you decided what job to look for next?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想回星天应聘初级行政助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to go back to Xingtian to apply for junior administrative assistant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你确认真的可以入职吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you sure you can really be hired there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请问这个职位是属于哪个部门？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, which department does this position belong to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听说星天重业务轻行政，没有专门的行政部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hear Xingtian prioritises production over admin and has no separate admin department.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司只有两个行政助理，负责全公司的杂务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The company has just two admin assistants handling odd jobs across the whole firm.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "做全公司的杂务，你不觉得委屈吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Doing odd jobs for the whole company, do you not feel shortchanged?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对我来说，足够了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For me, that is more than enough.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "毕业以后咱们也得在城里扎个根。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看这张传单，写着最低价租房，还介绍工作。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你想好接下来找什么工作了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想回星天应聘初级行政助理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你确认真的可以入职吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请问这个职位是属于哪个部门？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听说星天重业务轻行政，没有专门的行政部。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司只有两个行政助理，负责全公司的杂务。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "做全公司的杂务，你不觉得委屈吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对我来说，足够了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Starting again from the bottom handling office chores, Xiaogu gets her foot back inside Xingtian. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
